---
// FAQ.astro
---
<section class="py-16 bg-gray-50 px-4">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
    <div class="text-center mb-10">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">
        Frequently Asked <span class="text-blue-600">Questions</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600 text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Got questions about our RO services? Find answers to the most common queries about RO repair, maintenance, pricing, and service policies. Can't find what you're looking for? Just give us a call!
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-4">
      <!-- Question 1 -->
      <details class="group bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100 overflow-hidden [&_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-5 cursor-pointer hover:bg-gray-50 transition">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
            <i class="fa-regular fa-circle-question text-blue-600 text-xl"></i>
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-800 text-left">How long does a typical RO service take?</h3>
          </div>
          <span class="transition group-open:rotate-180">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down text-gray-400"></i>
          </span>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-5 pb-5 pt-0 text-gray-600 border-l-4 border-blue-200 ml-12 pl-4">
          A standard RO service usually takes 45-60 minutes, depending on the type of service required. Basic cleaning and filter checks take about 30-45 minutes, while comprehensive servicing with part replacements may take up to 90 minutes.
        </div>
      </details>

      <!-- Question 2 -->
      <details class="group bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100 overflow-hidden [&_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-5 cursor-pointer hover:bg-gray-50 transition">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
            <i class="fa-regular fa-circle-question text-blue-600 text-xl"></i>
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-800 text-left">What warranty do you provide on repairs and services?</h3>
          </div>
          <span class="transition group-open:rotate-180">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down text-gray-400"></i>
          </span>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-5 pb-5 pt-0 text-gray-600 border-l-4 border-blue-200 ml-12 pl-4">
          We provide a 30-day warranty on all repairs and a standard manufacturer warranty on all genuine spare parts replaced during the service.
        </div>
      </details>

      <!-- Question 3 -->
      <details class="group bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100 overflow-hidden [&_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-5 cursor-pointer hover:bg-gray-50 transition">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
            <i class="fa-regular fa-circle-question text-blue-600 text-xl"></i>
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-800 text-left">Do you use genuine spare parts for all RO brands?</h3>
          </div>
          <span class="transition group-open:rotate-180">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down text-gray-400"></i>
          </span>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-5 pb-5 pt-0 text-gray-600 border-l-4 border-blue-200 ml-12 pl-4">
          Yes, we strictly use authentic, original spare parts from authorized dealers for all brands including Kent, Aquaguard, Pureit, etc.
        </div>
      </details>

      <!-- Question 4 -->
      <details class="group bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100 overflow-hidden [&_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-5 cursor-pointer hover:bg-gray-50 transition">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
            <i class="fa-regular fa-circle-question text-blue-600 text-xl"></i>
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-800 text-left">How often should I service my RO water purifier?</h3>
          </div>
          <span class="transition group-open:rotate-180">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down text-gray-400"></i>
          </span>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-5 pb-5 pt-0 text-gray-600 border-l-4 border-blue-200 ml-12 pl-4">
          It is highly recommended to service your RO purifier at least once every 6 months and replace the filters annually for optimal performance and water safety.
        </div>
      </details>

      <!-- Question 5 -->
      <details class="group bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100 overflow-hidden [&_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-5 cursor-pointer hover:bg-gray-50 transition">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
            <i class="fa-regular fa-circle-question text-blue-600 text-xl"></i>
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-800 text-left">What areas do you cover for RO services?</h3>
          </div>
          <span class="transition group-open:rotate-180">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down text-gray-400"></i>
          </span>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-5 pb-5 pt-0 text-gray-600 border-l-4 border-blue-200 ml-12 pl-4">
          We currently provide doorstep RO services across the entire Delhi NCR region, including Delhi, Noida, Gurugram, Ghaziabad, and Faridabad.
        </div>
      </details>
    </div>

    <!-- Still Have Questions Box -->
    <div class="mt-12 bg-blue-50 rounded-2xl p-8 text-center border border-blue-100">
      <i class="fa-regular fa-circle-question text-blue-600 text-5xl mb-4"></i>
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Still Have Questions?</h3>
      <p class="text-gray-600 mb-6 max-w-xl mx-auto">
        Our customer support team is here to help! Get instant answers to your RO service queries through phone, WhatsApp, or schedule a free consultation.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center gap-4">
        <a href="tel:9873881738" class="bg-blue-600 text-white font-semibold px-6 py-3 rounded-lg hover:bg-blue-700 transition">
          Call +91-9873881738
        </a>
        <a href="https://wa.me/919873881738" target="_blank" class="bg-white text-blue-600 border-2 border-blue-600 font-semibold px-6 py-3 rounded-lg hover:bg-blue-50 transition">
          <i class="fa-brands fa-whatsapp mr-2"></i> WhatsApp Us
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>